01:31.220 --> 01:34.570
We're in the first half of the FC Peimonte vs. AC Emiria game.

01:33.660 --> 01:37.620
-Italy- Piemonte Stadium

01:34.570 --> 01:38.140
Xavier, the team leader, passes the ball to Hyuga.

01:41.860 --> 01:44.210
Hyuga has created himself a great chance!

01:44.210 --> 01:46.140
Now he only has to shoot!

01:46.140 --> 01:48.900
Damn it, I won't let you!

01:55.180 --> 01:57.570
Hyuga jumps in order to avoid the tackle!

01:57.570 --> 01:59.820
The powerful tackle of Jerome misses its target!

02:08.100 --> 02:09.860
Now's the moment!

02:17.540 --> 02:18.660
Eat this!

02:29.380 --> 02:34.500
<b>Tears of a Striker</b>

02:29.380 --> 02:34.500
<b>Tears of a Striker</b>

02:34.500 --> 02:37.740
Thanks to a powerful strike, the ball shoots towards the goal!

02:41.100 --> 02:43.540
So close! It hit the post!

02:43.540 --> 02:45.760
Hyuga's shot just hit the goal post!

02:45.760 --> 02:49.020
His first shot on goal in the Italian League wasn't good!

02:53.950 --> 02:56.560
Darn, that was so close, man.

02:56.560 --> 02:58.940
I was sure he'd score.

03:03.740 --> 03:05.320
How did I miss the goal?

03:17.360 --> 03:18.820
Eat this!

03:19.780 --> 03:23.350
The defender's hand touched me, putting me off balance.

03:23.350 --> 03:27.290
Because of that, I wasn't able to hit the ball at the center.

03:27.970 --> 03:29.400
I will score the next time!

03:29.400 --> 03:30.620
There won't be a next time.

03:30.620 --> 03:31.380
What!?

03:32.030 --> 03:33.870
You won't get a next time.

03:33.870 --> 03:37.380
I've already got the rhythm of your play down.

03:39.220 --> 03:42.900
That's why I'll crush you during this game.

03:48.340 --> 03:50.530
Emiria attacks Piemonte!

03:50.530 --> 03:52.490
But Willem intercepts the ball!

03:52.490 --> 03:54.460
The ball quickly goes up the field.

03:54.460 --> 04:02.210
But the excellent defender from France's national team, Jerome, marks the rookie Hyuga closely.

04:02.210 --> 04:05.980
Is he treating Hyuga like a world-class player?

04:07.980 --> 04:10.460
Hyuga, get rid of your marker!

04:11.980 --> 04:14.460
Hyuga runs towards the ball!

04:14.460 --> 04:16.490
Jerome's after him!

04:16.660 --> 04:19.970
Ouch! Jerome suddenly rams him with a powerful shoulder charge!

04:20.630 --> 04:24.370
Hyuga crashes into the ground, but the referee doesn't whistle.

04:27.950 --> 04:29.500
Damn!

04:40.900 --> 04:43.900
All right. I'll shake him off with my speed!

04:50.620 --> 04:54.940
Jerome has already discovered Hyuga's physical weak points.

04:56.300 --> 04:59.320
Your left leg is less powerful than your right leg.

04:59.320 --> 05:04.960
You won't last long in Division 1 Italian League soccer with a physical balance like that.

05:09.330 --> 05:11.100
Your physical balance is really bad.

05:11.100 --> 05:14.460
With a body like yours, you won't be able to play in Division 1 Italian League soccer.

05:14.460 --> 05:17.880
Was Mazz right about that being my weak point?

05:17.880 --> 05:19.460
Hyuga!

05:21.740 --> 05:24.000
I'm Piemonte's forward!

05:24.000 --> 05:28.780
If my right leg's too powerful, I'll have to challenge you with it!

05:35.000 --> 05:37.340
Hyuga's going into shooting position.

05:37.340 --> 05:39.820
But Jerome's getting in the way with his body.

05:40.500 --> 05:44.500
Oh! Jerome stopped the shot with a header!

05:54.540 --> 05:55.590
Kojiro!

05:55.590 --> 05:57.600
We're truly in the Italian League's First Division.

05:57.600 --> 05:59.100
The battle is intense.

05:59.100 --> 06:02.860
Hyuga's not getting up. Is he injured?

06:01.310 --> 06:02.860
Big Brother!

06:09.010 --> 06:10.710
I won the challenge.

06:10.710 --> 06:12.610
Hey, bring out a stretcher.

06:12.610 --> 06:14.260
Screw you!

06:16.720 --> 06:19.540
I won't go off the field because of a small thing like this!

06:25.410 --> 06:28.150
Hyuga gets up and resumes playing.

06:33.110 --> 06:37.900
After only 15 minutes in the first half, the battle is already this intense!

06:41.740 --> 06:45.260
There's no way in hell I'm losing to this guy!

06:48.380 --> 06:50.370
The ball is coming towards Hyuga again.

06:56.300 --> 07:00.940
Jerome's close marking of Hyuga completely shuts him down!

07:01.740 --> 07:03.940
Jerome committed a foul.

07:05.150 --> 07:07.930
Damn, why am I getting exhausted?

07:09.440 --> 07:11.320
Theodul, warm up.

07:11.320 --> 07:12.460
Yes.

07:14.910 --> 07:18.090
On the bench, the forward, Theodul, starts to warm up.

07:18.090 --> 07:21.400
Does Coach Moretti want to replace Hyuga?

07:21.400 --> 07:24.980
A goal! I need to score or else everything will be over for me.

07:25.710 --> 07:27.320
What's happening?

07:27.320 --> 07:28.980
Hyuga is going back to the middle of the field.

07:29.900 --> 07:31.460
He's finally running away.

07:31.810 --> 07:33.350
What's wrong, Hyuga?

07:35.220 --> 07:37.540
You're going for it, Kojiro?

07:40.610 --> 07:43.580
The ball! Pass me the ball!

07:43.580 --> 07:45.820
Piemonte has the free kick.

07:45.820 --> 07:47.660
This is your last chance, Hyuga!

07:50.300 --> 07:53.100
I'll never run away! This is a challenge, Jerome!

07:54.650 --> 07:59.940
Wow, Hyuga is accelerating up the field into Emiria's territory!

07:59.940 --> 08:02.940
But over there, Jerome is waiting for him!

08:02.940 --> 08:05.600
Is that your last gasp, Hyuga?

08:05.600 --> 08:08.460
Come. I accept your challenge!

08:08.460 --> 08:12.620
Jerome, I'll defeat you and be sure to score a goal!

08:12.620 --> 08:16.460
You'll witness the shot I developed in Japan!

08:22.510 --> 08:27.180
Hyuga's powerful shot is lifting Jerome into the air!

08:27.180 --> 08:29.380
That was payback for last time!

08:30.080 --> 08:33.420
This time, Jerome is being slammed into the ground!

08:33.420 --> 08:35.890
My true challenge is with this second shot!

08:53.590 --> 08:57.350
It's been stopped! Jerome stopped the shot perfectly!

08:57.350 --> 09:01.180
He forced his cleats into the ground and stopped Hyuga's shot.

09:01.830 --> 09:05.570
Hyuga's shot doesn't reach the goal in this Italian League's First Division.

09:05.570 --> 09:08.660
Standing before Hyuga is the thick, impregnable wall of a defender.

09:08.660 --> 09:11.660
This is the European wall!

09:11.660 --> 09:16.330
Am I not up to the standard of the Italian League's First Division?

09:16.330 --> 09:18.700
Or that of the rest of the world?


09:20.520 --> 09:24.700
Ah, this is it for Hyuga. He's being replaced by Theodul.

09:26.280 --> 09:28.620
Is my job over with this?

09:29.380 --> 09:34.800
Too bad, Hyuga. I still had fun with our challenge, though.

09:45.430 --> 09:47.110
Keep your head high.

09:47.110 --> 09:50.790
To lower your head means that you're admitting defeat.

09:50.790 --> 09:53.700
Get off the field with dignity and your head lifted.

09:58.380 --> 10:03.740
That's the last thing I can do when leaving this field.

10:03.740 --> 10:11.740
Hyuga, your pride and your attitude are worthy of First Division Italian League soccer.

10:18.500 --> 10:20.300
Coach Kira.

10:22.200 --> 10:24.820
Oh, it's you.

10:24.820 --> 10:27.060
Kojiro will be fine.

10:28.080 --> 10:33.420
The heavier the load on his back, the stronger he springs back up. 

10:36.270 --> 10:38.940
I'm leaving Kojiro in your care.

10:42.930 --> 10:46.420
Hyuga leaves the field during the 31st minute.

10:47.040 --> 10:50.770
Hyuga's debut in the Italian league only lasted for 31 minutes.

10:50.770 --> 10:55.050
Unfortunately, he didn't score or make any assists.

10:59.750 --> 11:01.460
You did well, Hyuga.

11:03.460 --> 11:05.540
Good job, Hyuga.

11:10.420 --> 11:13.260
Go! Get up the field!

11:13.260 --> 11:17.100
Hyuga, your battle is only just beginning.

11:17.100 --> 11:26.100
Together, we'll work on your body to make it more balanced and powerful.

11:26.100 --> 11:29.730
And you'll be a real <i>giocatore</i>

11:26.100 --> 11:30.040
Note: "Player" in Italian.

11:29.730 --> 11:33.100
when you get back to the field.

11:33.650 --> 11:39.140
For now, don't forget this game.

11:52.540 --> 11:56.500
-Turin- FC Piemonte's Club House {Theodul? sigh -_-*}

12:02.750 --> 12:03.540
Excuse me.

12:04.450 --> 12:07.910
Carlo, nice strategy you used during yesterday's game.

12:09.690 --> 12:14.020
You used Hyuga and his unbalanced body to your own advantage.

12:15.210 --> 12:20.900
You knew that the rookie, Hyuga, wouldn't be able to beat Emiria's defense,

12:20.900 --> 12:26.820
but you sent him out anyway, knowing that he'd disturb their defensive rhythm.

12:28.390 --> 12:32.500
And when the defenders finally adapted to Hyuga's rhythm,

12:32.500 --> 12:34.430
you subbed Theodul in.

12:34.430 --> 12:36.580
Everything went like you planned.

12:40.530 --> 12:45.820
The winning goal Theodul scored can be half attributed to Hyuga.

12:45.820 --> 12:53.500
Jerome, who marked Theodul, hurt his abdomen and ankle in his run-ins with Hyuga.

12:54.130 --> 12:58.500
The newspaper says he'll need a week to recover.

12:59.020 --> 13:01.500
But Carlo, I'm against it!

13:01.500 --> 13:05.540
I don't want you to use Hyuga as some horse you're betting against!

13:05.540 --> 13:07.340
I'm completely against it!

13:11.900 --> 13:15.820
Just as I thought, you're similar to Hyuga.

13:15.820 --> 13:18.450
What? I am? How?

13:21.600 --> 13:24.100
You also get hot-headed quite fast.

13:25.260 --> 13:28.620
Mazz, I'm leaving Hyuga in your care.

13:30.020 --> 13:33.520
Our ace, Pacciani, will be back for the second game.

13:33.520 --> 13:37.620
Hyuga won't even have a place on the bench for a while,

13:37.620 --> 13:44.860
but I believe that Hyuga can become Piemonte's ace striker.

13:44.860 --> 13:47.980
That's why I'm leaving him in your care.

13:47.980 --> 13:52.380
Mazz, make sure he attains the body of a real soccer player.

13:53.130 --> 13:54.020
Carlo...

13:54.790 --> 13:56.640
Do you accept?

13:56.640 --> 13:57.820
I do.

13:58.460 --> 13:59.020
Come in.

14:00.380 --> 14:02.040
Pardon me.

14:02.650 --> 14:05.550
Excuse me, is Hyuga-kun here?

14:05.550 --> 14:07.680
Did something happen to him?

14:08.370 --> 14:12.710
He's not here, even though he told me he had appointment with a doctor.

14:13.260 --> 14:15.010
Hyuga's not here?

14:18.260 --> 14:22.220
-Spain- Barcelona

14:23.020 --> 14:26.540
Cataluña B's Mini Stadium

15:14.660 --> 15:21.460
You won't find a single nail on that field because I'm the one who takes care of it.

15:22.390 --> 15:25.300
Yeah, it's really nice turf.

15:25.300 --> 15:28.300
Do you always check out the field like that?

15:28.300 --> 15:32.630
Yes, I do it before a game to know the height of the grass,

15:33.670 --> 15:36.640
but also the state of the soil and the humidity.

15:36.640 --> 15:40.300
The ball reacts differently depending on the turf's condition.

15:40.760 --> 15:47.060
I always touch the turf in order to get a feel for it.

15:47.060 --> 15:51.060
I see. If I'm right, you're the B team's...

15:51.060 --> 15:54.140
Yes, my name's Ohzora Tsubasa.

15:54.140 --> 16:00.420
I'm Serge, the grounds keeper, and I've been here for 20 years.

16:00.420 --> 16:04.580
It's been a long time since I've seen a player actually touch the turf.

16:04.580 --> 16:06.500
Really?

16:06.500 --> 16:09.350
The turf is a living thing.

16:09.350 --> 16:16.850
It's important for the grounds keepers and the soccer players to be friends with the field.

16:16.850 --> 16:17.890
It is!

16:17.890 --> 16:21.790
It should be easy with this turf, though.

16:21.790 --> 16:24.520
Take your time and build that friendship.

16:24.520 --> 16:25.420
I will.

16:27.960 --> 16:33.380
I'll finally be able to play for the first time in Europe.

16:33.370 --> 16:35.970
I was shocked to hear it would be in the B team,

16:35.970 --> 16:39.750
but once again, I was made to feel the difficulty the world has to offer.

16:40.700 --> 16:46.220
The day I'll be on Japan's team for the International Cup

16:46.900 --> 16:49.030
feels so far away, after all.

16:50.150 --> 16:52.260
But I'll get there!

16:52.260 --> 16:56.740
And to get there, I have to start here.

16:57.580 --> 17:01.740
My dream starts here, today!

17:17.200 --> 17:21.290
Even in Spain, few people come to see a second division game?

17:22.210 --> 17:25.610
So this is where Tsubasa is making his European debut?

17:30.990 --> 17:34.880
Hey, Pinto. Is Tsubasa Ohzora that amazing?

17:34.880 --> 17:38.910
Yeah, when it comes to his skills, he doesn't lose - even to Rivaul!

17:38.910 --> 17:42.460
Why is an amazing player like that on the B team?

17:42.460 --> 17:44.040
I don't know.

17:44.040 --> 17:45.460
But I do know,

17:45.460 --> 17:50.460
if you miss this game, you'll regret it for the rest of your lives!

17:59.980 --> 18:01.260
Captain!

18:03.140 --> 18:04.900
All right, let's do this, guys!

18:04.900 --> 18:06.940
Yeah!

18:11.340 --> 18:13.460
Right this way.

18:13.460 --> 18:14.970
Pardon me.

18:15.620 --> 18:19.340
Just as I thought, Coach Edward. You came to watch.

18:20.050 --> 18:22.380
You, too, Rivaul?

18:22.380 --> 18:23.600
Yes.

18:31.310 --> 18:32.460
It's Tsubasa!

18:32.460 --> 18:33.900
Tsubasa! Tsubasa!

18:41.860 --> 18:43.660
He's Number 10 and the captain, huh?

18:44.220 --> 18:49.660
Even on the B team, that number fits you nicely.

18:52.110 --> 18:56.180
You must've felt this assignment to the B team as your first setback.

18:56.180 --> 19:01.660
And the challenge from the coach to score ten goals and have ten assists during the year...

19:04.820 --> 19:08.260
Even for you, that won't be easy.

19:10.650 --> 19:16.700
We've come to Europe to realize our dream of winning the International Cup.

19:18.750 --> 19:25.230
But we're both facing the walls the world has placed before us.

19:28.560 --> 19:33.300
So what kind of play will you show us during this game?

19:37.860 --> 19:39.810
Tsubasa, are you really going for it?

19:40.490 --> 19:41.660
Yeah.

20:00.380 --> 20:02.420
This can't be happening...

20:05.420 --> 20:06.820
He did it!

20:06.820 --> 20:08.070
Awesome!

20:08.070 --> 20:10.640
He scored a goal seven 
seconds into the first half!

20:10.640 --> 20:12.500
Tsubasa! Bravo, Tsubasa!

20:13.780 --> 20:15.020
Tsubasa!

20:15.020 --> 20:17.300
All right, we've already scored one!

20:17.300 --> 20:20.370
Tsubasa, your plan worked!

20:21.680 --> 20:24.150
Damn, he got us!

20:24.150 --> 20:25.220
Don't let them look down on us.

20:25.220 --> 20:26.210
Let's go at it, too!

20:26.210 --> 20:27.140
Yeah!

20:38.420 --> 20:39.540
Tsubasa!

20:43.110 --> 20:44.410
Nice pass!

20:45.200 --> 20:46.600
All right, I've got it!

20:46.600 --> 20:47.380
No way!

20:48.310 --> 20:49.140
Oh, damn!

20:57.740 --> 21:01.500
Whoa! Tsubasa scored his second goal just as quickly!

21:03.900 --> 21:06.900
Tsubasa, your plan worked once again!

21:06.900 --> 21:09.420
All right, let's keep going at it!

21:20.590 --> 21:22.520
Come on, we're wasting time.

21:22.520 --> 21:23.660
Let's quickly get back to it.

21:23.660 --> 21:25.460
Damn, who's that guy!?

21:25.460 --> 21:27.270
He's cocky as hell!

21:27.270 --> 21:29.810
Don't let him score any more!

21:29.810 --> 21:32.460
Let's show him what we're worth.

21:34.590 --> 21:40.260
Rivaul, Tsuabsa Ozhora will turn into a nice rival for you.

21:40.260 --> 21:41.020
He will.

21:52.740 --> 21:55.210
I don't have the time to stop.

21:55.210 --> 21:57.330
I need to keep on running!

21:57.330 --> 22:02.150
I need to run so that I can realize my dream of winning the International Cup!

22:04.020 --> 22:11.020
Preview

22:05.400 --> 22:07.780
I've debuted in Spain's Division Two League,

22:08.280 --> 22:10.700
but I don't have the time to stop.

22:10.700 --> 22:14.860
I'll meet Coach Edward's challenge of ten goals and ten assists

22:14.860 --> 22:17.300
so I can be part of the main team.

22:17.810 --> 22:19.780
I'll go at it for real!

22:19.780 --> 22:22.740
I can't run away from Cataluña!

22:23.660 --> 22:25.620
Next time, on Captain Tsubasa:

22:25.620 --> 22:28.060
Go for 10 Goals, 10 Assists!

22:25.780 --> 22:34.100
Go for 10 Goals, 10 Assists!

22:28.060 --> 22:29.420
Look forward to it!

22:29.420 --> 22:31.980
Let's face our future! Kick off!

23:02.660 --> 23:08.820
<b>Nervously looking up in the darkness, I sway</b>

23:02.660 --> 23:08.820
<b>Nervously looking up in the darkness, I sway</b>

23:08.820 --> 23:14.660
<b>as my reckless past haunts me.</b>

23:08.820 --> 23:14.660
<b>as my reckless past haunts me.</b>

23:14.660 --> 23:20.900
<b>Remember what you pledged to the sky.</b>

23:14.660 --> 23:20.900
<b>Remember what you pledged to the sky.</b>

23:20.900 --> 23:24.820
<b>Find your way.</b>

23:20.900 --> 23:24.820
<b>Find your way.</b>

23:27.420 --> 23:29.740
<b>Sing and dance.</b>

23:27.420 --> 23:29.740
<b>Sing and dance.</b>

23:29.740 --> 23:32.220
<b>You have to try what you want to do first.</b>

23:29.740 --> 23:32.220
<b>You have to try what you want to do first.</b>

23:33.660 --> 23:35.660
<b>Don't forget your dream.</b>

23:33.660 --> 23:35.660
<b>Don't forget your dream.</b>

23:35.660 --> 23:38.180
<b>Risk everything you have and walk your own path.</b>

23:35.660 --> 23:38.180
<b>Risk everything you have and walk your own path.</b>

23:39.860 --> 23:41.740
<b>Don't run away from here.</b>

23:39.860 --> 23:41.740
<b>Don't run away from here.</b>

23:41.740 --> 23:44.420
<b>Leave your tears behind on a Tuesday morning.</b>

23:41.740 --> 23:44.420
<b>Leave your tears behind on a Tuesday morning.</b>

23:45.740 --> 23:47.740
<b>It's time for a comeback.</b>

23:45.740 --> 23:47.740
<b>It's time for a comeback.</b>

23:47.740 --> 23:50.260
<b>I'll always be there by your side forever and ever.</b>

